<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>经络 - 标签 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%9C/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.1 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Mar 2026 10:45:24 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/tags/%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%9C/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>藏府经络先后病脉证第一</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-01/</link><pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 10:55:24 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/jingui-01/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E9%87%91%E5%8C%AE/">金匮</category><description>&lt;p&gt;杂病的范围牵扯很广，但是所有的方子基础都在伤寒论，所以一定要有伤寒论做为基础，伤寒论的观念是同症同治。金匮就是因为病的种类比较多，症状又都不一样，但是诊断方式还是以阴阳表里虚实寒热八纲辨症为主，处方也是用阴阳表里虚实寒热来区分，但还是同症同治。在刚开始介绍杂病的时候，张仲景就讲了一些内经的理论。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>跟倪师学黄帝内经笔记之二：人体机理</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE0-2%E8%B7%9F%E5%80%AA%E5%B8%88%E5%AD%A6%E9%BB%84%E5%B8%9D%E5%86%85%E7%BB%8F%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BA%E7%90%86/</link><pubDate>Fri, 02 May 2025 20:14:22 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE0-2%E8%B7%9F%E5%80%AA%E5%B8%88%E5%AD%A6%E9%BB%84%E5%B8%9D%E5%86%85%E7%BB%8F%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%8C%E4%BA%BA%E4%BD%93%E6%9C%BA%E7%90%86/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E7%B4%A0%E9%97%AE%E7%AC%94%E8%AE%B0/">素问笔记</category><description>系统阐述了中医理论中&amp;quot;天人相应&amp;quot;的核心思想，揭示了人体生命活动与自然规律的深刻联系：以肾气盛衰为生命主线（女七男八为周期），通过阴阳平衡（上阳下阴、脏阴腑阳）、五行生克（五脏对应五时五气）、气血循环（气为阳主功能、血为阴主形质）维系生命活动，并具体表现为十二经络运行、五脏六腑协同、九窍通联天地的完整生理体系，强调唯有顺应四时阴阳、调和脏腑气血，方能达到&amp;quot;形与神俱，尽终天年&amp;quot;的健康状态。</description></item></channel></rss>